{"resource_id": "ntce.res.theory.piaget_development", "type": "pedagogical_theory", "title": "皮亚杰发生认识论与认知发展阶段理论", "scholar": "让·皮亚杰 (Jean Piaget)", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m5.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory", "ntce.zhongxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r012"], "summary": "认知发展通过同化、顺应达到平衡，经历四个阶段：感知运动阶段（0-2岁，客体永久性）、前运算阶段（2-7岁，万物有灵论、自我中心性、不可逆、未守恒）、具体运算阶段（7-11岁，守恒性、可逆思维、群集结构）、形式运算阶段（11-16岁，命题逻辑、假设演绎、抽象思维）。", "exam_focus": "各阶段标志性特征对应年级学生的认知发展规律，小学对应具体运算阶段，中学对应形式运算阶段。", "source": {"standard_id": "ntce.outline.302", "origin_file": "权威资料/text/ntce.outline.302.txt"}, "copyright": {"authorization_status": "public_domain", "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "source_nature": "compiled_selection"}}
{"resource_id": "ntce.res.theory.vygotsky_zpd", "type": "pedagogical_theory", "title": "维果茨基文化历史发展理论与最近发展区理论", "scholar": "列夫·维果茨基 (Lev Vygotsky)", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m5.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory", "ntce.zhongxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r012"], "summary": "儿童心理发展具有两种水平：现有水平（独立活动达到的解决问题水平）和潜在水平（在有指导或与更有能力的同伴合作下达到的解决问题水平）。两者之间的差距就是「最近发展区（Zone of Proximal Development, ZPD）」。由此提出「教学应当走在发展的前面」，并衍生出支架式教学（Scaffolding）。", "exam_focus": "教学必须着眼于最近发展区，为学生提供适当难度的教学内容与动态支架，超越现有水平促进向潜在水平转化。", "source": {"standard_id": "ntce.outline.302", "origin_file": "权威资料/text/ntce.outline.302.txt"}, "copyright": {"authorization_status": "public_domain", "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "source_nature": "compiled_selection"}}
{"resource_id": "ntce.res.theory.erikson_crisis", "type": "pedagogical_theory", "title": "埃里克森心理社会发展阶段理论", "scholar": "埃里克·埃里克森 (Erik Erikson)", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m5.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory", "ntce.zhongxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r012"], "summary": "个体人格发展贯穿一生，历经八个阶段的危机解决：学前期（3-6岁，主动感对内疚感）、学龄期（6-12岁，勤奋感对自卑感）、青年期/中学阶段（12-18岁，自我同一性对角色混乱）。中学生核心任务是建立自我同一性，防止同一性混乱。", "exam_focus": "中小学教师必须根据学生所处危机阶段提供针对性心理引导，帮助小学生树立勤奋感，帮助中学生探索自我角色与理想。", "source": {"standard_id": "ntce.outline.302", "origin_file": "权威资料/text/ntce.outline.302.txt"}, "copyright": {"authorization_status": "public_domain", "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "source_nature": "compiled_selection"}}
